    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d397">

                <pb facs="0532" n="452" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg452"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Tower.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August 13,
                        1901</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 247.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 454 of the 27th ultimo, reporting the arrest and expulsion from the Russian
                    Empire of Mr. George Kennan, an American citizen.</p>
                <p>In reply I have to say that the incident attracted little attention in this
                    country, the expulsion not having been attended with any action occasioning
                    complaint on Mr. Kennan’s part.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
